  "title": "Timur (Tamerlane)",
  "summary": "Timur, born in 1336 in the Kesh (Shahrisabz) area, rose from a Turkified Chaghatayid Mongol clan to master Transoxiana and make Samarkand his capital. His campaigns reached Iran, India, Syria and Anatolia, and he founded the Timurid dynasty. He died at Otrar in February 1405 while marching on China.",
